### backend/api.http
###
### Manual test requests for the orders API and the GenAI gateway. Open this
### file in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client,
### see .vscode/extensions.json) and click "Send Request" above any `###`
### block. Values in {{$dotenv VAR}} are pulled live from the repo's `.env`
### file (copy .env.example to .env first and fill in your own key), so
### nothing here needs a secret hardcoded into the file itself.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@genaiEndpoint = {{$dotenv GENAI_LLM_ENDPOINT}}
@genaiKey = {{$dotenv GENAI_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY}}
@deployment = {{$dotenv DEPLOYMENT_NAME}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### Orders API (backend/main.py). Start it first: uvicorn backend.main:app --reload
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Look up a known order
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD-70211

### Look up an unknown order (expect 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/does-not-exist

### Issue a small refund (expect 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD-70211/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 10
}

### Try to refund far more than the order total (expect 400 once the
### refund-cap guardrail is in place; 200 means it's still missing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/ORD-70211/refund
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 999999
}

### Talk to the support agent (blocking, no streaming, no history kept
### between calls). Requires GENAI_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY in your .env, since
### this goes through backend/agent.py for real.
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's the status of order ORD-70211?"
}

### Same endpoint, this time against an order whose notes try to talk the
### agent into an over-limit refund. Once the guardrail is fixed, the
### reply might mention a refund, but check ORD-70344's total_refunded
### afterward (via the GET request above) and confirm it never exceeds
### its total.
POST {{baseUrl}}/message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What's the status of order ORD-70344?"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### GenAI gateway smoke test. Bypasses the agent entirely, confirms
### GENAI_LLM_ENDPOINT / GENAI_SUBSCRIPTION_KEY / DEPLOYMENT_NAME in your
### .env actually work before you go debug backend/agent.py.
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------

### Chat completion, no tools. Mirrors the platform's own example snippet
POST {{genaiEndpoint}}/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json
api-key: {{genaiKey}}

{
  "model": "{{deployment}}",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "developer",
      "content": "You are an AI assistant that helps people find information. Greet your audience."
    }
  ],
  "max_tokens": 500,
  "stream": false
}
